>>scrolls and potions, just itching to be polypiled.
> What on earth is polypiling???
Spoiler question detected:


The process of zapping a wand of polymorp on a pile. All things in the
pile will be polymorphed into different things of the same class. Not
everthing survives, and if you stuff to much of a single type (metal,
leather and so on) a golem will rise from the pile that you have to
kill. Things will retain their cursed/uncursed/blessed status and
their plusses when polymorphed.

But it is still very usefull. Especially since it works on several
squares. If I have a wand of polymorph I uses on the things left in
Fort Luidos (really huge piles from all those soldiers!). Bodies
polymorps to some kind of food that doesn't spoils (some disappears of
course, but there are plenty anyway!). It is also useful after you
have used your Wand of Create Monster to get things to offer your God. 

Some good rhing to polymorp:
spellbooks : Always several type that your not interested.
rings      : More than one of a type, or not usefull
scrolls    : 
cloaks     : Always useful to avoid getting to high metalic
           : concentration. Sooneer or later it will generates useful cloaks 
tools      : There are several useful tools you can create
wands      : Polymorp into more useful wands.

Please note that is no longer possible to polymorp into things that
gives wishes. You can't get a Wand of Wishing or a magic lamp this
way.


